{% extends "eng/_layout.txt.j2" %}
{#- MALFORMED_PDF - ingestion: truncated or structurally invalid PDF -#}
{% block subject %}We could not open your PDF: the file appears to be incomplete{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The PDF attached to your message could not be opened. Part of the file is
missing or was damaged on the way to us, so the pages inside it cannot be
read.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please open the PDF on your own device to confirm that every page
displays. If it opens correctly for you, send it again — the copy that
reached us was most likely damaged during the upload. If it does not open
for you either, please create the PDF again from the original scan or
document and send the new file.{% endblock %}
